    "description": "Progress test 2 30.0%",
    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">DTG111 · Assessment 3/4</span>\n<h2>Progress test 2</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 13451 · assessment table (verbatim)</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">DTG111 · Đầu điểm 3/4</span>\n<h2>Progress test 2</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 13451 · bảng đánh giá (nguyên văn)</p></div>\n<div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type / Loại</span><span class=\"v\">on-going</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Weight / Trọng số</span><span class=\"v\">30.0%</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Parts / Số phần</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Completion criteria / Điều kiện hoàn thành</span><span class=\"v\">&gt;0</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Duration / Thời lượng</span><span class=\"v\">180m</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">CLO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO1, CLO2, CLO3, CLO5, CLO6, CLO7, CLO8</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Question type / Dạng câu hỏi</span><span class=\"v\">Students will receive the assignment instructions and requirements directly from the instructor.<br>Create a media graphic product: poster, social media content, promotional design... using Adobe Photoshop.<br>AI integration.<br>Option 1 (AI as Idea Partner)<br>Students will use one or more AI tools to generate ideas for a specific media graphic product.<br>Students are then required to recreate the AI-generated idea using Photoshop tools.<br>Submission must include: Original Photoshop working file (.PSD), exported outputs in the required formats and documentation of the AI-generated idea.<br><br>Option 2 ( AI as Creative Element Generator):<br>Students may first propose their own product idea, discuss and confirm it with instructor.<br>After idea approval, students will use Photoshop to create the final product, while being allowed to use AI tools to generate supporting elements.<br>Submission must include: Original Photoshop working file (.PSD), exported outputs in the required formats and documentation of the AI-generated idea.</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">No. of questions / Số câu</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Knowledge &amp; skill / Kiến thức &amp; kỹ năng</span><span class=\"v\">Use Photoshop tools effectively for image editing, photo manipulation, and digital compositing.<br>Produce creative outputs such as posters, social media graphics, or promotional materials.</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Grading guide / Hướng dẫn chấm</span><span class=\"v\">in class, by instructor</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Note / Ghi chú</span><span class=\"v\">This project must be completed at home, and students are expected to integrate AI tools responsibly into their creative process.</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Sessions in the plan that mention it</h3>\n<ul><li>Session 19 — Progress test 1: Design a vector-based graphic product</li><li>Session 36 — Progress test 2: Create a media graphic product</li><li>Session 37 — Progress test 2: Create a media graphic product</li><li>Session 38 — Progress test 2: Create a media graphic product</li><li>Session 39 — Progress test 2: Create a media graphic product</li><li>Session 48 — PREPARE FOR ASSIGNMENT 3:</li><li>Session 60 — ASSIGNMENT 3:</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Buổi trong kế hoạch có nhắc tới</h3>\n<ul><li>Buổi 19 — Progress test 1: Design a vector-based graphic product</li><li>Buổi 36 — Progress test 2: Create a media graphic product</li><li>Buổi 37 — Progress test 2: Create a media graphic product</li><li>Buổi 38 — Progress test 2: Create a media graphic product</li><li>Buổi 39 — Progress test 2: Create a media graphic product</li><li>Buổi 48 — PREPARE FOR ASSIGNMENT 3:</li><li>Buổi 60 — ASSIGNMENT 3:</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">No practice paper for this subject in the Exam Room yet.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">Phòng thi chưa có đề luyện cho môn này.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Exam-strategy notes and worked past papers: coming later.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Chiến lược làm bài và chữa đề: sẽ bổ sung sau.</div></div>"
